<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 52 0 R
/T (Signature-based layer Suricata 6.0.20 runs the ET Open ruleset \(52,148 rules\) alongside custom local rules; YARA provides hash- and pattern- based malware detection. Catches known-bad traffic with high precision and low latency, and corroborates or escalates findings from the ML and behavioral layers.)
