/T (A second model generation \(v2\) was retrained with absolute timestamps and 26 additional non-live-derivable columns removed, specifically to reduce leakage and improve deployability against real Suricata-captured traffic. This validation work directly informs an ongoing retraining effort aimed at closing the remaining gap between laboratory-trained features and what is actually observable in live network capture.)
